flowchart TD
    A[User opens application] --> B[Login page]
    B --> C[Click Sign in]
    C --> D[Redirect to SSO Provider]

    D --> E[User authenticates with SSO]
    E --> EF{SSO auth success?}
    EF -- No --> EF1[Show auth error / retry]
    EF -- Yes --> F[SSO returns ID token / access token / claims]
    F --> G[Backend Auth Callback]

    G --> H{Is token valid?}
    H -- No --> H1[Reject login and show error]
    H -- Yes --> I[Extract user identity<br/>email / subject id / groups / roles]

    I --> J{User exists in app DB?}
    J -- No --> K[Create user profile<br/>pending / default role]
    J -- Yes --> L[Load existing user profile]
    K --> M[Resolve organization mapping]
    L --> M

    M --> N{Organization mapping found?}
    N -- No --> N1[Mark user as unassigned / deny access / send to onboarding]
    N -- Yes --> O[Resolve role and entitlements]

    O --> P[Create app session / issue app JWT if needed]
    P --> Q[Redirect to Dashboard]

    Q --> R[Dashboard bootstrap API called]
    R --> S[Backend loads organization context]
    S --> T[Load role permissions]
    T --> U[Load subscription / billing status]
    U --> V[Load enabled scanner catalog]
    V --> W[Load org profile + secret metadata + recent scan history]

    W --> X[Render dashboard]
    X --> X1[Organization Profile]
    X --> X2[Billing / Subscription]
    X --> X3[API Key / Secret Configuration]
    X --> X4[Scanner Tiles]
    X --> X5[Audit / Recent Activity]

    X4 --> SA1[Scanner 1 Tile]
    X4 --> SA2[Scanner 2 Tile]
    X4 --> SA3[Scanner 3 Tile]
    X4 --> SA4[Scanner 4 Tile]
    X4 --> SAN[Scanner N Tile]

    %% Secret setup flow
    X3 --> Y[Org admin adds or updates API key / credential]
    Y --> Z[Frontend sends secret securely to backend]
    Z --> AA[Backend validates request + org ownership + role]
    AA --> AB{Authorized to manage secrets?}
    AB -- No --> AB1[Reject action + audit failure]
    AB -- Yes --> AC[Encrypt in transit / avoid logging plaintext]
    AC --> AD[Store secret in Vault]
    AD --> AE[Store only metadata in App DB<br/>vault path / secret id / status / created by]
    AE --> AF[Write audit log for secret creation/update]
    AF --> AG[Refresh dashboard secret status]

    %% Billing flow
    X2 --> BA[Org admin views plan or starts payment]
    BA --> BB[Frontend calls Billing Service]
    BB --> BC[Create payment order / checkout session]
    BC --> BD[Redirect to Payment Gateway]
    BD --> BE[User completes payment]
    BE --> BF[Gateway sends webhook to backend]
    BF --> BG[Backend validates webhook signature]
    BG --> BH{Webhook valid + not replayed?}
    BH -- No --> BH1[Reject webhook + alert/log]
    BH -- Yes --> BI[Update payment record]
    BI --> BJ[Update subscription / entitlements / plan limits]
    BJ --> BK[Write audit log for billing change]
    BK --> BL[Refresh dashboard billing state]

    %% Scanner manifest sync (boot + admin refresh)
    B0[CP boots] --> B1[ScannerSyncService.refreshAll]
    B1 --> B2[For each SCANNER_N_BASE_URL: GET /api/manifest]
    B2 --> B3{Manifest fetch ok?}
    B3 -- Yes --> B4[Upsert Scanner row<br/>name, description, credentialSchema,<br/>dashboardBaseUrl, iconUrl<br/>availability=AVAILABLE]
    B3 -- No --> B5[Mark availability=UNAVAILABLE,<br/>store lastError, log]

    %% Scanner tile click + run
    SA1 --> CA[User clicks scanner tile]
    SA2 --> CA
    SA3 --> CA
    SA4 --> CA
    SAN --> CA
    CA --> CA1[Frontend opens ScanModal]
    CA1 --> CA2[Render credentialSchema via @rjsf/core]
    CA2 --> CA3[User fills credentials, submits]
    CA3 --> CB[POST /scans/run<br/>scannerKey + credentials]
    CB --> CC[Backend ScansService.requestRun]
    CC --> CD[Auth + org context guards]
    CD --> CE[Load Scanner row]
    CE --> CF{Scanner AVAILABLE?}
    CF -- No --> CF1[409 Scanner unavailable]
    CF -- Yes --> CG[Validate credentials<br/>against credentialSchema with Ajv]
    CG --> CH{Valid?}
    CH -- No --> CH1[400 + field errors]
    CH -- Yes --> CI[Create ScanJob<br/>status=DISPATCHED, generate nonce]
    CI --> CJ[POST baseUrl/api/scan with credentials,<br/>HMAC-signed]
    CJ --> CK{Scanner ack 2xx?}
    CK -- No --> CK1[ScanJob.status=FAILED, capture error]
    CK -- Yes --> CL[Persist externalScanId from ack]
    CL --> CP[Return jobId to frontend]

    %% Scanner runs async, calls back when done
    CP -.async.-> GT[Scanner POSTs /scanner-callbacks/:scannerKey/:jobId]
    GT --> GU[CallbackVerifierService verifies HMAC + nonce]
    GU --> GV{Signature + nonce valid?}
    GV -- No --> GV1[401, no state change]
    GV -- Yes --> GW[CallbackHandlerService.handle]
    GW --> GX[bcrypt-hash viewSecret, store on ScanJob]
    GX --> GY[Update status + summary]
    GY --> GZ[Audit log]

    %% View report
    R1[User clicks View Report on completed scan] --> R2[GET /scans/:id/report]
    R2 --> R3[CP calls scanner POST /api/scans/:scanId/view-token<br/>HMAC-authed]
    R3 --> R4[Scanner returns short-lived plaintext]
    R4 --> R5[CP returns redirectUrl =<br/>dashboardBaseUrl?scanId=...&secret=plaintext]
    R5 --> R6[Frontend window.location.assign redirectUrl]

    %% Data segregation / tenant boundary
    subgraph Tenant_Security_and_Data_Isolation
        TS1[Every request carries user identity]
        TS2[Backend maps identity to org_id]
        TS3[Every DB query filtered by org_id]
        TS4[Secrets fetched only from org-owned vault path]
        TS5[Results tagged and retrieved by org_id]
        TS6[Audit logs record actor, org, action, timestamp]
    end

    O --> TS1
    M --> TS2
    T --> TS3
    AD --> TS4
    GZ --> TS6
    AF --> TS6
    BK --> TS6
